@title Castlevania - Harmony of Dissonance (USA)
@file Castlevania - Harmony of Dissonance (U) [!].gba
@game ACHE
@chip SRAM
@status wip: reaches Juste's first control on the castle bridge after the Juste/Maxim dialogue (New Game, name "A"); holding RIGHT runs into a giant armoured monster that blocks the bridge, and the first save needs Juste to get past it into the castle and reach the first save room (combat and platforming). A human should record: Game Start, New Game, name, skip the dialogue, fight/run through the entrance to the first save room, stand in it until the save message, quit. [load]: Game Start > Select data > DATA1 > resume in the save room.

[new]
wait 600
press START
until text "START" timeout=600 every=10
wait 30
checkpoint title window=30 compare=text
press START
until text "INFORMATION" timeout=600 every=10
wait 30
press A
until text "DATA1" timeout=600 every=10
wait 30
checkpoint select_data window=0 compare=text
press A
wait 120
checkpoint name_entry window=0
# name "A": A types it, START confirms
press A after=20
press START after=60
until text "Simon" timeout=900 every=10
checkpoint story compare=text
until text "CASTLEVANIA" timeout=6000 every=20
until notext "CASTLEVANIA" timeout=3000 every=20
until text "Juste" timeout=900 every=10
wait 60
checkpoint bridge_dialogue compare=text
mash A until text "inside" timeout=3000 every=40
press A after=60
wait 200
checkpoint gameplay window=30
